title: "Advanced Robot Navigation"
abstract: >-
  Course notes, lecture slides, and Python starter code for an advanced
  graduate course on autonomous navigation, bridging maritime and aerospace
  inertial navigation with modern robotics. The text and figures are licensed
  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; the code is licensed MIT.
